        <mxCell id="nd" value="‘DID THE CDC LAND IN BRONZE?’   Kafka-Exporter consumer-lag   ⇔   Databricks max(load_ts) age / Anomaly-detection freshness on the bronze Delta table" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE0B2;strokeColor=#E65100;fontSize=9;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="35" y="342" width="1110" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
