        <mxCell id="nh" value="STRAND 1 — per-team TAG (top-level col)&#10;= RLS key + chargeback + budget + job-pipeline key&#10;(keep as MAP; project to column)&#10;&#10;STRAND 2 — central metadata table&#10;update_workflow_info job_id (deploy→run link)&#10;+ dp-rlt mdle_monitor sink  [schema UNDOCUMENTED]&#10;&#10;STRAND 3 — ONE notification fan-out&#10;Grafana alerts + SQL Alerts → same Teams/webhook&#10;→ Azure Monitor (paging/retention)&#10;&#10;⇒ TWO dashboards · ONE alert dest · ONE tag · ONE metadata table · ONE seam" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF9C4;strokeColor=#F9A825;fontSize=9;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1195" y="155" width="272" height="590" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
